[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15300.71, "timestamp": "04:15:00", "text": "转动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15304.03, "timestamp": "04:15:04", "text": "嗯，轮到你了，我知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15308.429, "timestamp": "04:15:08", "text": "我知道自己肯定做不好，但还是试试吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15311.87, "timestamp": "04:15:11", "text": "好的，嗯，为了方便理解，这是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15314.83, "timestamp": "04:15:14", "text": "实际上，ja n 是第一次玩这个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15318.349, "timestamp": "04:15:18", "text": "游戏，我的意思是，严格来说不算游戏，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15322.349, "timestamp": "04:15:22", "text": "不，但其实是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15326.109, "timestamp": "04:15:26", "text": "好的，呃，告诉我你好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15328.91, "timestamp": "04:15:28", "text": "准备好说明书"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15331.87, "timestamp": "04:15:31", "text": "等等，我应该把手册展示出来吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15334.59, "timestamp": "04:15:34", "text": "直播什么的，还是我应该就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15336.99, "timestamp": "04:15:36", "text": "我的意思是，这取决于你，我正在展示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15339.229, "timestamp": "04:15:39", "text": "不过我的上面也有，哦，你把它展示了出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15342.55, "timestamp": "04:15:42", "text": "我的好了，让我快速地做一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15348.469, "timestamp": "04:15:48", "text": "可听见的哦，是的，我注意到了，在中间偏中间偏中间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15359.349, "timestamp": "04:15:59", "text": "等等，你为它写了一首诗"}]